    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88585" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσανα-πληρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill up, replenish besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐνδεέστατον βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1256b3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.71
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν λείπουσαν ταῖς βασάνοις κόλασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					19.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑστερήματα τῶν ἁγίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					9.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.444
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐλλείποντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Pron.</u>
					3.7
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>add so as to fill up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				84d
			</span></i>.</div>
